        "TileImage": "$($repository 5a80073e-eb03-49c3-b380-696b70760937).Image",
        "Description": "A large criminal syndicate of depraved cannibals has infiltrated Dartmoor Manor, 47.\rThe two heads of the snake that controls this syndicate of demons are Ferdinand Britton and Manon Beaulieu. \rThey have come to the garden party to network for their cover business of coffee trading.. but their real intention is to find a delicious meal.. paired with fava beans and a nice chianti!!\rTake care of them, 47.",
